---

<Base
  title="Contenox — An agent server. Every AI product runs one. Nobody ships you one."
  description="An agent server. Apache made serving a website something you install and HTML something you author; contenox does that for agents. Declare an agent as one Markdown file, and every action it takes is checked against your policy before it runs. Open source, on your machine, any model."
  alternates={{ en: "/", de: "/de/" }}
>
  <Landing t={t} />
</Base>
